{"version":1,"key":"card:390","content":{"id":390,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4770fcbb-4d05-408a-8442-278cc23a2530","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"动态加载远程库的 demo，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"import()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 远程加载 CommonJS 的库。思路是在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"window"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象上创建一个临时的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"module"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，然后通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"import()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 远程加载这个库，库会挂载到这个临时对象上，加载成功后从这个临时对象上提取除库的内容返回，从而实现动态加载。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"797295d5-5bd3-4b12-a749-81562a25c3bf","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9e6faaeb-0cdd-46c0-8608-10ca5a060f04","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const require = async (url) => {\n  // 保存 window.module 原来的值，用以恢复\n  const _module = window.module;\n  \n  window.module = {};\n  await import(url);\n  // 获取到动态导入的库\n  const exports = window.module.exports;\n  // 恢复 window.module\n  window.module = _module;\n  \n  return exports;\n}\n\nrequire('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/reworkcss/css@latest/lib/parse/index.js').then(mod => {\n  console.log(mod);\n});","collabId":"a1a70aca-6218-454d-8c82-8728a05c0d57","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0c538ce7-1f90-452f-bcd5-7db78a95089b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这是一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"demo"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，还存在很多问题："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"e8f334bd-23d8-4d10-b123-ef28d93584d4","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b6bb793d-6d5d-4c0e-8988-a05ce9b200f7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3fa38be8-e9fc-437d-99a0-865434530ca2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"import()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 导入，这就要求这个库必须能在严格模式下运行"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"85b61748-40fa-4425-aeba-0e7045bbb5a2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5c9a8162-45ae-4486-9d52-ac3624751444","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"仅支持库没有依赖的动态导入"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3a116393-1006-4f8d-8d11-65fcd00de2d2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"418d724f-32df-4782-875e-9d9d5be721ee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为是异步导入，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"window.module"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个对象在导入的过程可能被更新，在恢复的过程中这个更新会被丢弃掉"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9b2c9c5a-037f-49bb-bb0e-e4bb7831b20f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a6cef427-4b6e-4a60-9e9a-bcd6628ef490","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"存在跨域的问题"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"49facc2d-e05e-4563-8cdb-ec591cc758ef","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disable